    "text": "Quick Links : About AKGEC Ajay Kumar Garg Engineering College (AKGEC) offers four year under graduate B.Tech course in all major engineering branches, two year post graduate M.Tech course in four engineering branches and two year post graduate MCA course. AJAY KUMAR GARG ENGINEERING COLLEGE Placed Students",
