    "text": "1. Adequate Number of Laboratories The department houses a sufficient number of laboratories, aligned with the student strength and the practical course requirements specified in the AKTU (Lucknow) syllabus. 2. Comprehensive Equipment and Tools Each lab is equipped with a wide range of hardware kits, instruments, software tools, and consumables to support both foundational and advanced-level experiments. 3. Curriculum-Aligned Setup Facilities are tailored to meet the specific needs of the syllabus, ensuring seamless integration with theoretical instruction and hands-on learning. 4. Advanced Technological Support Select labs feature modern digital interfaces, simulation software, and data acquisition systems to enhance experimental precision and analytical skills. 5. Research and Innovation Spaces Dedicated areas within the labs support faculty and student-led research, innovation projects, and interdisciplinary exploration. 6. Safety and Accessibility All laboratories are designed with safety protocols in place, including fire extinguishers, first-aid kits, and clear signage. Workstations are ergonomically arranged to ensure accessibility for all learners. 7. Dedicated Lab Personnel Each lab is managed by a designated staff member responsible for maintenance, inventory, and technical support during sessions. 8. Smart Resource Management A planned budget ensures timely procurement of consumables, repair of equipment, and upgrades to tools and software, maintaining operational efficiency.",
